OL,3,GNEWSAWarning of major M8 delays as
OL,4,Alanes close for bridge reinstallation
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being warned of delays of
OL,7,Fup to an hour on the M8 over the
OL,8,Fweekend with all lanes on sections of
OL,9,Fthe motorway set to close in the next
OL,10,Fstage of planned works.
OL,12,FThe M8 eastbound will be closed between
OL,13,FJunctions 24 (Helen Street) and
OL,14,FJunction 22 (Plantation). Westbound,
OL,15,Fthe closures will be between Junction
OL,16,F20 (West Street) and Junction 24. Parts
OL,17,Fof the M77 and M74 will also be
OL,18,Faffected.
OL,20,FThe closures will be in place from
OL,21,F18:00 on Saturday until 13:00 on
OL,22,FSunday. Diversions will be in place.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
